# Build inputs only, not builder state: a working tree's virtualenv and ruff cache
# are local, so the same commit would otherwise build a differently-shaped image per
# machine (Mf-uwqr). /data is the runtime data dir; the *.db globs above do not reach
# into it.
.venv
.ruff_cache
/data
